{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本8人男團timelesz的25歲成員猪俣周杜，上月18日在東京江東區一間便利店外涉嫌毆打20多歲女性友人面部，傷者在店員及目擊者協助下報警，猪俣否認指控，聲稱與女方爭執期間，手部不慎碰到對方，警方以傷人罪名把他拘捕。</p><p>事後所屬事務所Starto娛樂表示，已跟猪俣解約。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T12:42:40.195343+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:16:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:54:22.576026+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:38:10.619463+00:00","content_hash":"fc64c74681b90bd2eb43b8edcd997b7685562b51bf383e6628525eb3047b4d41","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}